<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NAB appoints new BNZ wholesale chief.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NAB appoints new BNZ wholesale chief.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank (NAB) Ltd said on Monday it had appointed Colin Campbell as general manager of wholesale banking at its Bank of New Zealand (BNZ) unit.</p>
<p>Campbell, who was head of Treasury distribution and delivery for NAB in Melbourne, replaces Geoff Cullen.</p>
<p>Cullen was recently appointed Executive Vice President and General Manager of Wholesale Banking for NAB in the United States.</p>
<p>Campbell, 40, takes up the position at BNZ in April.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
